# Commun App Environment Configuration

# Backend API base URL
# For Android Emulator: http://10.0.2.2:3001/api/user
# For iOS Simulator / Web: http://localhost:3001/api/user
# For Physical Android / iOS device: http://<your-local-ip>:3001/api/user
API_BASE_URL=https://api.commun.in/api/user

# Socket URL for real-time chat
SOCKET_URL=https://api.commun.in/api

# LocationIQ API Key for reverse geocoding
LOCATIONIQ_API_KEY=https://api.commun.in/api
